# Invitation Cards (hidden quest Invitation_Cards) next to Naja Salaheem's other Lua quests (the Aht Urhgan promotions,
# whose containers run before the card quest's): a level 75 Warrior in Aht Urhgan Whitegate with the PSC Wildcat Badge,
# an Imp Wing, the Red and Blue Invitation Cards, and AssaultPromotion 25 (Private First Class available). The
# promotion's 5000 / 5001 / 5002 win over the card's 74; once it is completed (AssaultPromotion 0) the card's 74 plays. Then Naja's Toau missions: Astral Waves current
# (3052, a tie with the card's 74: the trigger order shows who wins); Knight of Gold (3021) is #rivals_gold.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/74
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=75
charvar AssaultPromotion 25
keyitem PscWildcatBadge
keyitem RedInvitationCard
keyitem BlueInvitationCard
item ImpWing
login
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # available: 5000
finish                                  # begun
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # accepted: 5001
finish
trade Naja_Salaheem ImpWing x1          # 5002
finish                                  # completed
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # the promotion is done: the card's 74
update 74 option=1
finish option=0
mission Toau AstralWaves current        # 3052 against the card's 74
trigger Naja_Salaheem
finish
trigger Naja_Salaheem
finish
